$$\hat{x} + x_{2}^{1} + \binom{1}{2} + \cancel{x}$$

$$\left\{\begin{array}{l}1 \\ 2\end{array}\right. + x + \frac{1}{2} + \sum\limits$$

$$(x) + \begin{pmatrix}1 & 2 \\ 3 & 4\end{pmatrix} + | + \operatorname{lim}\limits$$

$$\overbrace{x}^{1} + \overbrace{x}^{1} + \overline{x} + \overbrace{x}^{1} + \overset{1}{x}$$

$$''' + \sqrt[3]{x} + x + \to$$

$$\underbrace{x}_{1} + \underbrace{x}_{1} + \underline{x} + \underbrace{x}_{1} + \underset{1}{x} + \left(\begin{matrix}1 \\ 2\end{matrix}\right)$$

$$\left[\begin{matrix}1 \\ 2\end{matrix}\right]$$

$$\sum_{k=0}^{n} k  = 1 + 2 + \dots + n  \\   = \frac{n(n+1)}{2}$$
